                        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                            An <strong>Effluent Treatment Plant (ETP)</strong> is a specialized industrial wastewater treatment system designed to treat and purify highly contaminated industrial wastewater (known as effluent) before it is discharged back into the environment or reused within the factory.
